  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0130_71814b6f0ad1.png\" style=\"width: 345px; height: 431px;\" /></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Slope of tangent at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Equation of tangent is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;Area of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p>Area of curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></msubsup><msqrt><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Required shaded area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
